\"TEXT\">P</field></shadow></value></block></statement></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></statement></block><block type=\"procedures_callnoreturn\" id=\"#,8wBqcRnh|L~:~:rP%,\" x=\"35\" y=\"107\"><mutation name=\"NommagePoints\"></mutation></block></xml>","sync":"/**\n * Décrire cette fonction…\n */\nfunction NommagePoints() {\n  if ((cCentre) == 0) {\n     var blockly_var_decal = 15;\n    TURTLE_UP(true);\n    TURTLE_FONT('Verdana',18,'normal','center');\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((A));\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(54);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    BLK_STL(\"listA\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('A'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('Q'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((B));\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(28);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    BLK_STL(\"listB\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('B'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('S'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((C));\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(54);\n    BLK_STL(\"listC\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('C'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('R'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((D));\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(40);\n    BLK_STL(\"listD\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('D'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('T'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((E));\n    BLK_STL(\"listE\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(13);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('E'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('U'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((G));\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    BLK_STL(\"listG\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('G'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('H'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((H));\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    BLK_STL(\"listH\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(13);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('H'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('G'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((J));\n    BLK_STL(\"listJ\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(1);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('J'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('K'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((K));\n    BLK_STL(\"lisK\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('K'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('J'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((N));\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    BLK_STL(\"listN\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(13);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('N'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('V'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((O));\n    BLK_STL(\"listO\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(66);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('O'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('W'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((P));\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(66);\n    BLK_STL(\"listP\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('P'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('X'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((Q));\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(54);\n    BLK_STL(\"listQ\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('Q'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('A'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((R));\n    BLK_STL(\"listR\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('R'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('C'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((S));\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(28);\n    BLK_STL(\"listS\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('S'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('B'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((T));\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(40);\n    BLK_STL(\"listT\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('T'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('D'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((U));\n    BLK_STL(\"listU\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(55);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('U'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('E'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((V));\n    BLK_STL(\"V\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('V'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('N'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((W));\n    BLK_STL(\"listW\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_COLOUR(18);\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('W'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('O'));\n    }\n    TURTLE_JOIN_PT((X));\n    BLK_STL(\"listX\",\"setLayer\",[-1]);\n    TURTLE_RESET();\n    TURTLE_MV(blockly_var_decal,true);\n    if ((ChInv) == 0) {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('X'));\n    } else {\n      TURTLE_PRINT(TURTLE_TEXT('P'));\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n\nNommagePoints();","parents":["cCentre","A","ChInv","B","C","D","E","G","H","J","K","N","O","P","Q","R","S","T","U","V","W","X"]},"current":"onlogo"});


// Texts :
Text("<div style='font-size:16px;color:#CC0000;text-align:center'>Exploration des contours minimaux du $5 \\times 5$<div style='font-size:14px;color:#FF0000;text-align:left'>\nChoix de la pi\u00e8ce centrale  <select target=\"ChPieces\">\n<option value =\"0\">Aucune</option>\n<option value =\"1\">A - inv Q</option>\n<option value =\"2\">B - inv S</option>\n<option value =\"3\">M - auto inv</option>\n<option value =\"4\">L - auto inv</option>\n<option value =\"5\">I - stable</option>\n<option value =\"6\">W - inv O</option>\n<option value =\"7\">R - inv C</option>\n<option value =\"8\">H - inv G</option>\n<option value =\"9\">F - auto inv</option>\n<option value =\"10\">U - inv E</option>\n<option value =\"11\">T - inv D</option>\n<option value =\"12\">J - inv K</option>\n<option value =\"13\">V - inv N</option>\n</select> \n<div style='color:#0000FF'>\nJeu de couleurs    <select target=\"JeuxCoul\">\n<option value =\"1\">1. Origine</option>\n<option value =\"2\">2. HUEG jaunes</option>\n<option value =\"3\">3. Variante</option>\n<option value =\"4\">4. contours minimaux</option>\n</select> \n<div style='color:#0000FF'>\nCacher :  a) les ancres <input type=checkbox target=\"cAncre\">    b)  le contour <input type=checkbox target=\"cContour\">\n<div style='color:#000000'>\nPrendre les pi\u00e8ces inverses <input type=checkbox target=\"ChInv\"> ",27,8,374,187,"c:rgba(239,178,121,0.18);s:3;r:15;p:4");
